                                "sense_id": "cbee1db4-ad0f-362e-8842-616f2e153131",
                                "text": "The point of the example is educational, moral, and the moral qualities of the stories attracted Peter Flanagan who remembered them from childhood and told them to the cutties and cubs when he was, for them, a funny old man."
